.TH "AG\-CLI\-REPO\-EDIT" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-repo\-edit \- Edit repository settings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli repo edit [<owner>/<repo>] [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Edit supported repository metadata and visibility on AtomGit.
.PP
\&Only flags explicitly provided are sent to AtomGit; omitted settings remain
\&unchanged. Name and visibility updates require confirmation unless \-\-yes is
\&used. \-\-visibility, \-\-public, and \-\-private are mutually exclusive.
.PP
\&This command does not change the repository path, owner, homepage, LFS state,
\&module switches, merge policies, or other unsupported GitHub CLI settings.
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-default\-branch <string>\fR
\&New default branch
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-d, \-\-description <string>\fR
\&New repository description
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-name <string>\fR
\&New repository name (does not change the repository path)
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-private\fR
\&Make the repository private
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-public\fR
\&Make the repository public
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-visibility <string>\fR
\&New visibility: public or private
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-y, \-\-yes\fR
\&Skip confirmation for name or visibility changes
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&# Update the current Git repository
\&  ag\-cli repo edit \-\-description \(dqNew description\(dq
.PP
\&  # Update an explicitly selected repository
\&  ag\-cli repo edit owner/repo \-\-description \(dqNew description\(dq
.PP
\&  # Clear a description without changing other settings
\&  ag\-cli repo edit owner/repo \-\-description \(dq\(dq
.PP
\&  # Update several settings
\&  ag\-cli repo edit owner/repo \-\-name \(dqNew name\(dq \-\-default\-branch main \-\-visibility private
.PP
\&  # Skip confirmation for a visibility update
\&  ag\-cli repo edit owner/repo \-\-public \-\-yes
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
